bin/
dist/
coverage.out
.dev-agents/
.claude/

# local design-preview scratch (regenerated from the live template)
.panel-*.html

# never again: a data dir under Desktop triggers macOS TCC prompts on every rebuild
.dev-agents/

# e2e harness deps (bun.lock is committed; the tree is not)
node_modules/

# The embedding sidecar's local venv: created by the operator, never committed.
contrib/embed-sidecar/.venv/
__pycache__/

# go-task fingerprint cache
.task/

# Generated by the release's BEFORE HOOKS, which the gate now runs: `task
# test:archive` builds the archives so tools/archivecheck can open one, and the
# hooks drop all of these into the working directory on the way. Only `dibs.1`
# was listed, because until the gate built a release nothing produced the rest
# outside the release job, and the first local snapshot staged four untracked
# artifacts including a whole signed .app bundle.
#
# Committing the man pages would keep a second copy of the help text, and the
# copy loses. Kept complete by TestEveryReleaseHookOutputIsIgnored rather than
# by memory.
/dibs.1
/dibd.8
/Dibs.app
/dibs-presence-arm64
/dibs-presence-amd64

/dibs
/dibd
/dibs-presence

# EVERY tools/<name>. `go build ./tools/<name>` drops the binary in the working
# directory and `git add -A` sweeps it in: three shipped in one commit that way,
# because the no-compiled-binaries gate reads TRACKED files and the gate had run
# before the add. One was committed on an earlier occasion too, and it embedded
# the builder's home directory in every path the Go toolchain bakes in.
#
# ANCHORED, all of them. Unanchored, `signstable` also matched the DIRECTORY
# tools/signstable/, so the tool `task install` runs was never committed at all
# and a fresh clone could not run it. git said nothing, because an ignored path
# is not an untracked one.
#
# Kept complete by TestEveryToolBinaryIsIgnored rather than by memory: a list
# like this goes stale one entry at a time, and the entry it is missing is
# always the newest tool.
/appbundle
/archivecheck
/casknote
/covergate
/fetchpinned
/signcheck
/signid
/signstable
/smoke
/stampserver
/version
